            "more2_p": "The steel hook with the black handle catches the rim of the cup, so your fingers never touch the hot ceramic.",
            "more3_h": "Clean in a minute",
            "more3_p": "Empty the used cup once it has cooled, rinse it, and it is ready for the next evening."
          }
